-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025, August to September came in at just 40% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, May to June ran the other way, at 187% of normal on the middle.</p>"}
